# Binary source and package-name ownership for core-ui assets.
#
# The profile tiles live in `core/ui/vendor/` because `:core:ui` is what
# decodes them (`TaffyProfileAvatar.kt`), and they are renamed into the
# `profile-banners/` asset directory that decoder asks for. Gradle reads
# its own copy under `core/ui/src/main/assets/`; GN has no variant merge
# and takes the vendor tree, which is the one carrying the provenance
# record `core/ui/vendor/taffy-profile-banners.txt`.
